\par\par \b \uc2 HKMA Injects HK$1.938 Bln Into  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market in Defense of HK Dollar Peg\b0\par\par\uc2 By Fiona Law   \par \uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 2014\par 13:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires Chinese (English)\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG--The \uc2 Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the city's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , injected cash into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday to cool down the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After the market close in the city, the HKMA pumped 1.938 billion Hong Kong dollars (US$250 million) into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the local unit hit the strong side of its trading band, according to Thomson Reuters Eikon data.\par \par \uc2 The move comes a week after the HKMA injected HK$16.267 billion (US$2.1 billion) into the market in defense of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg last Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg permits the Hong Kong dollar to trade between HK$7.75 and HK$7.85 to the U.S. dollar. The HKMA undertakes to buy or sell the local unit whenever it touches either side of the band.\par \par \uc2 Demand for the city's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has risen recently, partly because of increased corporate demand for commercial activities, such as mergers and acquisitions and dividend payments, the HKMA said earlier.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar remained strong even after the HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and was trading close to 7.75 per dollar late in the Asian day.\par \par \uc2 Write to Fiona Law at fiona.law@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 09-07-14 1122GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020140709ea7900084\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
